    <briefdescription>
<para>Strategy for sampling traces. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Three built-in strategies are provided:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>ALWAYS_ON (default) – every span is recorded.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>ALWAYS_OFF – no spans are recorded (useful for benchmarks).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>PROBABILITY – each span is independently sampled with the configured probability in [0.0, 1.0].</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>PARENT_BASED – follow the sampling decision of the parent span; falls back to PROBABILITY for root spans.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>ADAPTIVE – automatically scales the sample probability down when the span creation rate exceeds a configured maximum (spans/second), and restores full sampling when the rate drops back below the threshold. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
